        <Document ID="C3050EB1-2E89-440A-B895-34CF98E879FD">
            <Title>scene 3</Title>
        </Document>
        <Document ID="CC61F107-A42E-4176-9EA8-63DDAF3E061B"/>
        <Document ID="D8A88026-2149-4126-B63A-A2621473222A">
            <Title>scene</Title>
            <Text>Autumn walked out into the the warm evening air. In the summer the sun didn’t set until around seven so that would give her about an hour to make it home. Her funky night vision made driving in the dark a little scary. It was like everything was normal one minute and the next someone had turned up the brightness of the world so much that her vision went white.  Another symptom that had started after her fall. She kept meaning the see a doctor but who had the time. They were short handed at the storage place so between working extra hours, and volunteering with the children at rainbow house she barely had the energy or time for anything else. So seeing a doctor about her crazy vision would just have to wait.
As always Autumn had to parked across the street a block away from Rainbow House in front of the church. There were always people coming and going from the building. The church was very involved with community including Rainbow House. In fact she had first met Reverend Adams and Reverend Thomas at the Holiday fund raiser for Rainbow house. The two men had insisted that she use the church parking lot due to the lighting. Autumn usually stayed late and quickly accepted the offer. A girl cant be too careful. Especially after dark. The church reached out to the press to draw more attention to the needs at the orphanage. And man did it work. Reverend Adams and Reverend Thomas had provided cookies for the holiday bake sale. Between the press and the bake sale Rainbow house was able to raise more than enough money to get blankets and warm clothes for all the children.  Not to mention the anonymous donor who claimed he had seen the story on the news and wanted to brighten the holidays for the children.  With his extremely generous donation all the children had gifts under a very tall Christmas tree. 
Autumn phone dinged pulling her out of her thoughts. Reaching into the side pocket of your cross body purse Autumn snagged the phone and what do you know. Adam needed her to work extra hours in the morning.
 A hand grabbed Autumn suddenly as she attempted to step off the curb and cross the street. She tried to pull away but stopped as a truck speed past without ever tapping the brake. 
Watch where you’re going said a deep voice from a stranger.
Oh my goodness Autumn said over the sound of her own heart pounding. You saved my life.  That truck came out of nowhere. Thank you.
The stranger stayed silent. His gaze was fixed on his own hand wrapped around her arm. He seemed to be lost in thought.
Are you ok, sir? Autumn asked. I think it safe to let go now she said with a grin.
Yes. he said finally letting go. You seem to be out of danger for now. And please call me Jack.
Autumn looked at her hero’s face for the first time and almost drowned in his dark blue eyes. Dark blue with a splash of aqua surrounding the pupil. Such a beautiful and interesting trait. Like living art.
Jack she said still unblinking
She tried not to stare but between those stormy blue eyes, that five o’clock shadow and that full bottom lip…Wow.  He was a near perfect. The stuff wet dreams were made of.
I- um I’m Autumn she stammered 
When had she developed a stutter? And when had her body started buzzing like a downed power line?
She shouldn’t be objectifying this man. The good ones were always taken anyway. But damn a girl could dream.
Well I better be going but thank you again. Thank you Jack.
Of course Jack responded

Of course Jack thought. Of course she was Autumn. He was still picking his tongue up off the sidewalk. This wayward fae knocked him on his ass and he couldnt stop staring at hers as she crossed the street to the church.
He had decided to start his search for Autumn at the orphanage. Hoping he would catch her there. He had spotted the petite female walking down the sidewalk in his direction. In the late afternoon light he could see the feminine sway of her hips. Was almost hypnotized by it. The closer she came the more entranced he became. When he heard the truck engine reeving a tingle started at the back of his neck. He saw the woman’s intended direction and knew what would happen without intervention. 
When he touched the womans arm he felt it. The tingle spread though his body like a shock wave. Follow by a healthy dose of lust and something else. Something he would have to ignore if was to complete this mission. And he would complete the mission for his queen.


After the drive home Autumn couldn’t wait to shower, slip into her PJs and curl up with a good book.
When she walked through the front door she could hear the bass notes of Work by Rihanna coming from the bathroom. Which meant Vi was hitting the club tonight. Vi was a social butterfly in every way. Social because she made friends easily and  the butterfly part explained itself as Violet gave her best diva walk into the living room. 
What do you think Violet asked. Is it too naked or just naked enough?
Her wavy ombre purple hair was slicked into a high pony and matched her electric lavender heels. When a girl had features like Vi she did not hide behind hair. Not to mention the thick thighs save lives that she was serving in her well fitted black and white floral romper. Her roomate was beautiful. 
Autumn had never felt beautiful in all of her twenty six years. Cute maybe but not beautiful.  Her gray eyes were a little big for her face but her lashes were nice and thick.  Her dark coils would never slick down like Vi’s. Instead Autumns hair was thick cluster of tight curls that did whatever they wanted most of the time. And if Autumn dared try to tame the locs with a slick back there would be hell to pay in the form of frizz.
You look great. Not too naked. Autumn said heading toward her bedroom
Thanks. Do you need help finding something to wear?
No Autumn replied. I know just the pair of comfy jammies Im looking for.
No ma’am. No jammies.  You need a night out. 
A night in? Autumn said
No you need a night out. Come dance with me Vi said winding her hips to the beat. 
Come on Autumsn. It will be so much fun besides your are too young and beautiful to be in the house every weekend.
 Im really tired Vi. Raincheck?
Fine Vi said but tomorrow is Saturday and I know you dont have to work so Im putting you on notice Autumn West. You are going out with me tomorrow night. And I will be especially hurt if you say no. Violet made sure to stick out her bottom lip and flash puppy eyes in Autumn’s direction.
Autumn took a deep breath and exhaled  knowing she had no other choice. Alright. You win. I could use a little fun after today. But first I need a hot shower and a night of rest.
Wait. What happened? Was you boss giving you a hard time again. He knows you have to leave by four to make it the Rainbow house for dinner on Friday nights. I swear. Friday is the only day you ask to leave early and he’s still——
No no Vi its not that. I… I almost got run over by a truck in front of Rainbow House. 
Oh my god Autumn. Are you alright? Are you hurt?
Yeah Im fine. I guess my luck is changing. This guy came out of nowhere and pulled me back onto the side walk just in time.
Thank goodness.
Yeah. Im fine. I just need to rest you know. Prepare for the adrenaline crash. Besides Adam needs me to come in early in the morning.
Of course. I’ll turn the music off so you can rest. Do you want me to stay in with you tonight?
No. I’m fine but thanks. Go have fun.
Ok Violet said hesitantly if you are sure
Im positive



After a quick shower Autumn slipped into her favorite PJs. In summer she preferred a light tank and very cute purple ruffle sleep shorts. Sometimes a girl just wanted to be a girl. Autumn curled  up in bed and before long was sleeping like a baby.
Autumn opened her eyes and stared at the stars in the night sky. Beautiful.  The stars seemed to be brighter and the sky darker. She sat up and rubbed her eyes. A warm breeze ruffled her curly hair. When had her bed been moved outside? She was dreaming. Her bed was in a forest under the stars. No doubt this was the same forest she had dreamed of the the past month. This was however the first time she had found herself in her bed in the forest.  Rustling beyond the trees caught Autumns attention. Intrigued but not afraid Autumn swung both feet over the side of the bed to stand on the grass. She could feel the grass between her toes. How?
Hey!
Autumn’s turned to the sound and frowned at the person who had emerged from the forest in front of her. What now? Did she really dream up a lover?
Long legs encased in low slung joggers moved swiftly in her direction. He looked ready for bed to her. The closer he came the better the view.  A very happy trail of dark hair cover his lower abs. And oh what wonderful abs they are. 
Damn when I dream up a man I check all the boxes.
When he stopped in front of her Autumn finally could see his face. Blue eyes the color of the sea looked down at her own.
Jack?
Autumn?
Wow. I only met the guy one time and I’m having a sex dream about him.  Autumn mumbled
“Sex dream?”  Jack interjected 
“He did save my life” Autumn continued thinking out loud. “Who wouldn’t want a real life hero? So what if its a desperate sex dream.”
“Desperate?”
He seemed almost offended. Of course her dream guy was sensitive too. 
Without wasting anymore time Autumn reached up to frame his face with her hands. The prickling of his five o’clock shadow sent tingles racing down her arms cause her nipples to tighten under her favorite tank top.
Jack opened his mouth on a rough inhale and Autumn wasted no time accepting the invitation.  She quickly rose to her tip toes and pressed her lips to his. She licked and nibbled at his full bottom lip. Sighing and moaning she let her pleasure be known.
Then with a deep moan Jack took control of the kiss. Pressing his lips roughly to hers with one hand at the base of her neck to accentuate his his command. His other hand swept down the side of her breast, skimmed over her waist and came to rest on her round backside.
Autumn took this as an invitation to rap her legs around Jack’s strong waist. Her arms were tingling before but now her whole body was buzzing like a live wire. She could help but shiver even though she wasn’t cold. Her body had never felt anything like this.
“Bed” Autumn demanded between warm kisses.
“Oh my fuck” Jack cursed turning to following her order
Jack could feel the wet heat of Autumns core pressed against his naked waist.
Stop his conscious yelled.  This isn’t right. But his conscious was a fucking lier. This felt all kinds of right. Jack let his finger slide underneath Autumns purple shorts. The treasure he found there would have brought him to his knees had he still been standing. 
“Fuck you’re wet. 
Autumn lay back with her beautiful brown thighs spread to welcome his every touch. She was arching her back and whimpering as he pump his finger in and out and in and out. 
She rode his finger to orgasm.
Fuck me Jack. Fuck me.
Her sweet filthy mouth would kill him if he wasnt careful.






